        aides: ["$v(t) = d'(t)$ et $(t^2)' = 2t$.", "$v(t) = 4{,}9 \\times 2t = 9{,}8t$.", `Résous $9{,}8t = ${nb(v)}$.`],
        solution: `$v(t) = d'(t) = 9{,}8t$. $9{,}8t = ${nb(v)} \\iff t = \\dfrac{${nb(v)}}{9{,}8} = ${nb(t0)}$ s.`
